  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_bison",
      "name": {
        "en": "Bison's Badge",
        "zh": "拜松证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Bison has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for preservation of the front and resilience against the enemy.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Defender Operator during field operations to exercise Protector responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员拜松擅长维持战线抵御敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为重装干员，行使铁卫职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_bison",
      "name": {
        "en": "'The Journey Thus Far'",
        "zh": "“一路以来”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_bison",
      "description": {
        "en": "Kazimierz. Maybe he once flinched at the impenetrably dense neon, but he knew his duty full well. The day he succeeded, concluded communications, and walked out that glass door, the eternal lights of the skyscrapers drew his shadow long, and it was only then that Bison realized it was late at night.\nLaterano. At the street corner where the structure above him collapsed with a boom, Bison caught a dessert that almost hit him in the head in his shock. The grand church briefly stole away his senses with its splendor under the sunlight. Soon after, he pushed the door open, where the Legati were sat to capacity inside.\nColumbia. The never-resting pioneer cities gave him a profound respect for humanity's sheer vitality, and the bleeding-edge science made him pore over every clause and turn of phrase in the contracts all the more carefully. Across from him sat several execs, and Bison was alone at the front of the desk.\nSami. He once tested his own disposition and momentarily set foot in the tundra, but unfortunately the youngster's willpower was hard-pressed to bear the might of nature. As Bison huddled in a blanket in the lodge, sipping hot water, a melodious singing voice reached his ears from outside the room. He crawled up to the window, and made a rough note of the lyrics.\nSiracusa. The sandstorm in the barrens tore the map he was holding to shreds, and Bison had to make it to his destination bar going by the lights alone. He pushed the door open, and the three Lupos inside fell silent. He coolly handed over the goods and info, and turned a blind eye to the cold glint of a firearm peeking out from under the blanket.\nYan. He's back somewhere familiar, and familiar too is the party that awaits him again as he enters. Bison recalls his surprise last time candy rained down on him from all over, but now he sees the chaos before him and simply takes the shield his redheaded mentor hands him, now in a very peculiar form indeed, making it hard to tell its original design was of his father's own style.\nHe uses the calm and coolness he's trained on the journey thus far to look as unflustered as possible, but all the charm from across the land flashes across his brain in an instant. Mixed with the music is an explanation to the rough tune of 'We were running a delivery and hit a snag, so we just grabbed it to save our hides. The mods were to make up for that.'\nBison accepts it, this present from his father, and plunging through the tunes and the scent of apple pie, he makes his way to the bar counter and begins to write a reply.\nTitle, greeting, main body. He inquires about his father's health, and writes of how his recent work has gone. He lifts his eyes to see champagne flying at the face of some unknown gang's goon, and Bison swiftly tucks the letter into his pocket and raises his shield.\nIf one day, he could take complete charge... on one hand, Bison is trying to reckon with what all these bells-and-whistles modules are even for, and on the other, his mind is looping the thought that he's going to make this place run like an orderly, regular business for just one month!\n...No, dream bigger! One year!",
        "zh": "卡西米尔。或许密不透风的霓虹曾经让他有些畏缩，但他清楚自己身上的责任。那天成功结束沟通后走出玻璃门，高楼上不灭的灯光拉长他脚下的影子，拜松这才意识到已是深夜。\n拉特兰。当街角的建筑物在他头顶轰然倒塌，拜松在震惊中接住了一块差点砸到他头上的甜点。宏伟教堂在阳光下的光芒短暂地夺走他的心神，随即他推开大门，里面坐满信使。\n哥伦比亚。拓荒城市的永不停歇让他对人类的生命力产生深深敬畏，前沿的科技也让他更加谨慎地在心中一遍遍斟酌着合同的条目与措辞。数位高层坐在对面，拜松一人坐在桌前。\n萨米。他曾试探性地短暂踏入冰原，可惜少年人的意气终究难以扛过自然的力量。当拜松在小屋中裹着毯子啜饮热水时，屋外悠扬的歌声传进耳朵。他趴在窗前，记下歌词的大意。\n叙拉古。荒漠的风沙扯碎他手中的地图，拜松凭着五彩灯光寻到了目的地酒吧。推门进去，里面的三个鲁珀安静下来。他镇定地递出货物与信息，无视毯子下闪着冷光的铳械。\n炎。回到他熟悉的地方，推门进去也仍旧是他熟悉的派对。拜松想起上一次漫天的糖果落下时自己的惊诧，现在他看着眼前的混乱，只是伸手去接红头发前辈拿出的一面已经变得古里古怪的盾牌，依稀能看出原本的设计是他父亲的手笔。\n他用一路以来磨炼出的坦然和冷静让自己的表情没有什么变化，但大地上风姿各异的一幕幕已经在一瞬间纷纷掠过他的脑海，音乐中夹杂着一些“正在送货结果遇上事了赶紧拿来挡挡，上面的改造是补偿”的解释。\n拜松接过这份来自父亲的礼物，在音乐与苹果派的香气中，绕去吧台开始撰写回信。\n称谓、问候语、正文，他问候父母的身体，写下最近的工作情况。一抬眼，香槟突然飞向门口一位不知名黑帮打手的脸，拜松利索地把信放进怀里，举起了盾牌。\n如果有一天，他能做到完全独当一面的话……拜松边试图弄清楚那些花里胡哨的模块是干什么的，边止不住地在脑子里想，他要让这里老老实实地按照正常企业的秩序运行一个月！\n……大胆点，一年！",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
